{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13468","headline":"蝉鸣一篇五章 二 · 宋华","name":"蝉鸣一篇五章 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"彼蝉鸣矣，於林之表。\n含风饮露，以乐吾道。\n有怀载迁，伊谁云保。\n未见君子，我心悄悄。\n既见君子，披豁予抱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋华","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13468.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13468","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}